# Local development rollback-anchor scratch: the throwaway witness store, its
# one-day attestation and the dev Hub state, written by
# scripts/DEV-ONLY-HUB-AND-WITNESS-SAME-HOST.*. Nothing here is an anchor and
# nothing here may ever hold value.
/.dev-anchor/

# The seeded design canvas: ~2.5 MB of editor payload regenerated from the
# .dc.html artboards beside it. The artboards are the source and are tracked;
# this is build output and does not belong in the history.
design/fast-pay-channel-flow.html

# Local build and download scratch, never part of the source. 2,854 files and
# ~210 MB sat here untracked with no rule covering them, which is one `git add
# -A` away from permanent in a public repository - and 21 of the build logs
# carry the owner's home path. `*.log` and `*.log.err` were listed; the bare
# `*.err` the logs actually use was not.
#
# This ignores UNTRACKED files only. Everything already tracked under releases/
# stays tracked, and its pending deletions stay exactly as they are.
releases/
*.err
